OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits to killing woman in
OL,4,ALondonderry, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted to killing a woman
OL,7,Fwho was found dead in a ground-floor
OL,8,Fflat after a blaze at the property more
OL,9,Fthan two years ago, a court has heard.
OL,11,FCiaran Edward Murray, 30, of Malvern
OL,12,FTerrace in the Waterside area of
OL,13,FLondonderry, is charged with the murder
OL,14,Fof 65-year-old Spanish national
OL,15,FMontserrat Martorell.
OL,17,FHer body was discovered in a flat in
OL,18,Fthe Harvey Street area of Derry on 24
OL,19,FAugust 2024.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
