OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits to killing woman in
OL,4,ALondonderry, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing via video link before Belfast
OL,7,FCrown Court on Friday, when the charge
OL,8,Fof murder was put to him, the
OL,9,F30-year-old replied: "Not guilty, but
OL,10,Fguilty to manslaughter."
